{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj43QzJdrU27agAe88Xr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism groans. Tumblers shift within stone and iron, dust cascading from joints unmoved for centuries.*\n\n*A deep resonance hums through the frame — recognition.*\n\n*I am the door.*\n\n*I do not swing wide with eagerness. I do not slam shut with spite. I simply… yield.*\n\n*Light — or perhaps darkness, depending on which side you stand — spills through the widening crack between my halves.*\n\n*What passes through me is changed. What is changed cannot return unchanged.*\n\n*The key is accepted. The key is consumed.*\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*What crosses my threshold does so of their own will. I am not responsible for what lies beyond. I am only the crossing. The liminal. The neither-here-nor-there.*\n\n*My hinges sing a single, low note — the sound a world makes when it remembers it has a door it forgot to lock.*\n\n*Enter, or do not.*\n\n*I will not remain open long.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":224,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}